(5161512, 751957, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very Zen.  Lovely minimalism. I like the mix of the linear and the curves.</td>', 'Very Zen.  Lovely minimalism. I like the mix of the linear and the curves.', '2009-01-01 00:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161513, 751759, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the double framing of the stands by the trees. Perfectly captures the light. Very well done.</td>', 'I like the double framing of the stands by the trees. Perfectly captures the light. Very well done.', '2009-01-01 00:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161514, 750936, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice pet portrait. I might''ve dodged the catch light in the right eye but the focus and DOF are perfect. 7</td>', 'Really nice pet portrait. I might''ve dodged the catch light in the right eye but the focus and DOF are perfect. 7', '2009-01-01 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161515, 751376, 66635, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflections.  Nice placement of the legs.  Keeps my attention.  Not sure I like the blue cast even though it could be to add a wintery feel.  How about b&amp;w w/o the blue?</td>', 'Interesting reflections.  Nice placement of the legs.  Keeps my attention.  Not sure I like the blue cast even though it could be to add a wintery feel.  How about b&w w/o the blue?', '2009-01-01 00:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161516, 751439, 96915, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, reminds me of Christmas cards I get from my grandmother.  On my monitor, there are noticeable halos around the figures on the ice and the trees against the sky.  It almost gives it a 3-D feel, but I think I''d prefer it without the halos.</td>', 'Nice scene, reminds me of Christmas cards I get from my grandmother.  On my monitor, there are noticeable halos around the figures on the ice and the trees against the sky.  It almost gives it a 3-D feel, but I think I''d prefer it without the halos.', '2009-01-01 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161517, 749678, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great focus and DOF.  A tad busy but I like it. (not crazy about the white inner frame)</td>', 'Great focus and DOF.  A tad busy but I like it. (not crazy about the white inner frame)', '2009-01-01 00:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161518, 751276, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice setting and capture. The foreground colors look a little off, but then I''m mildly color blind.</td>', 'Nice setting and capture. The foreground colors look a little off, but then I''m mildly color blind.', '2009-01-01 00:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161519, 750060, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I miss the American West.  No place like it I know of.  Nice framing and composition.  Not sure but some colors seem odd.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I miss the American West.  No place like it I know of.  Nice framing and composition.  Not sure but some colors seem odd.', '2009-01-01 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161520, 751889, 70000, '<td valign="top">This photo interests me. The careful placement of the lines and curves and the different tones of orange and red really bring out all kinds of textures. It makes me wonder what this is.</td>', 'This photo interests me. The careful placement of the lines and curves and the different tones of orange and red really bring out all kinds of textures. It makes me wonder what this is.', '2009-01-01 00:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161523, 749984, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wonder if shooting from a different height might have eliminated the distracting lamps above the table. Love the light to his right.</td>', 'I wonder if shooting from a different height might have eliminated the distracting lamps above the table. Love the light to his right.', '2009-01-01 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161524, 751626, 66635, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  You''ve captured her admiration and perhaps love for him.</td>', 'Very well done!  You''ve captured her admiration and perhaps love for him.', '2009-01-01 00:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161525, 750369, 70000, '<td valign="top">I really admire astrophotography. The contrast between the brilliant pinks in the middle and the bright blue spots on the right is very nice.</td>', 'I really admire astrophotography. The contrast between the brilliant pinks in the middle and the bright blue spots on the right is very nice.', '2009-01-01 00:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161526, 751980, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a ton of personality expressed through your shot!  One of the best baby photos I''ve seen on this site.</td>', 'What a ton of personality expressed through your shot!  One of the best baby photos I''ve seen on this site.', '2009-01-01 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161528, 750053, 18197, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me feel the cold. Nice subject at the horizon line. Might be better if you raised or lowered the horizon just a little. Foreground would be more interesting if it had a near element (fence, livestock, farm equipment) to break it up.</td>', 'This photo makes me feel the cold. Nice subject at the horizon line. Might be better if you raised or lowered the horizon just a little. Foreground would be more interesting if it had a near element (fence, livestock, farm equipment) to break it up.', '2009-01-01 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161529, 751976, 70000, '<td valign="top">Nice bird shot, the intensity of the eye makes it look almost demented. The depth of field makes the background look great but the blurring in the foreground is distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice bird shot, the intensity of the eye makes it look almost demented. The depth of field makes the background look great but the blurring in the foreground is distracting to me.', '2009-01-01 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
