(5161750, 751559, 70000, '<td valign="top">How fun! The texture over the shoulders makes the whole shot a little bit busier than my taste, I would have liked to seen the texture of the ribbons or the texture over the shoulder but not really both together. Great painting.</td>', 'How fun! The texture over the shoulders makes the whole shot a little bit busier than my taste, I would have liked to seen the texture of the ribbons or the texture over the shoulder but not really both together. Great painting.', '2009-01-01 01:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
