(5161850, 751428, 66635, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the water, but I think it would be better if I could see above the top of the waterfall, too.  I.e., I think you should have zoomed back a bit and shown more of the surroundings.</td>', 'I like the movement of the water, but I think it would be better if I could see above the top of the waterfall, too.  I.e., I think you should have zoomed back a bit and shown more of the surroundings.', '2009-01-01 03:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161851, 751084, 66635, '<td valign="top">Gosh, it really does look like they are going to fly!</td>', 'Gosh, it really does look like they are going to fly!', '2009-01-01 03:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161852, 748030, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2009-01-01 03:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161855, 751979, 66635, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Looks like a painting.  I like the vignetting.  Years ago I was driving north to south on the Golden Gate Bridge when the Blue Angels flew between the uprights right over me.</td>', 'Very nice!  Looks like a painting.  I like the vignetting.  Years ago I was driving north to south on the Golden Gate Bridge when the Blue Angels flew between the uprights right over me.', '2009-01-01 03:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161856, 751968, 66635, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I can''t quite figure it out.  The buildings look miniature.  It almost looks like it''s on television.  I don''t like the vignetting, though.</td>', 'Interesting.  I can''t quite figure it out.  The buildings look miniature.  It almost looks like it''s on television.  I don''t like the vignetting, though.', '2009-01-01 03:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161857, 751862, 66635, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I like the blue.  Very sharp.  Good eyes.</td>', 'Well done.  I like the blue.  Very sharp.  Good eyes.', '2009-01-01 03:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161860, 752000, 66635, '<td valign="top">I think it might benefit from a deeper depth of field - i.e., if his lips were also in focus, not just his eyes.</td>', 'I think it might benefit from a deeper depth of field - i.e., if his lips were also in focus, not just his eyes.', '2009-01-01 04:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161861, 751899, 66635, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Well-framed, too.  I could see this hanging on a wall somewhere.</td>', 'This is very nice.  Well-framed, too.  I could see this hanging on a wall somewhere.', '2009-01-01 04:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161862, 751659, 63633, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, but the lens distortion is off-putting to me.</td>', 'Love the concept, but the lens distortion is off-putting to me.', '2009-01-01 04:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161863, 751872, 66635, '<td valign="top">It makes me jealous of whoever caught that big one.  Was it a tuna?  Is it a fish market, or just a cleaning location?  IF it''s a fish market, it''s the cleanest one I''ve ever seen.  It seems like there should be a lot of blood.  You should have seen how nasty the fish market in Oman was.  And here in Senegal?  Wow.  The highlights in the back are a bit blown out, though.</td>', 'It makes me jealous of whoever caught that big one.  Was it a tuna?  Is it a fish market, or just a cleaning location?  IF it''s a fish market, it''s the cleanest one I''ve ever seen.  It seems like there should be a lot of blood.  You should have seen how nasty the fish market in Oman was.  And here in Senegal?  Wow.  The highlights in the back are a bit blown out, though.', '2009-01-01 04:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161864, 749637, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I love the background color and how it complements the moth.  I think I might like it better with a larger depth of field, though - i.e., if the front wing, at least, was also in focus.</td>', 'Awesome.  I love the background color and how it complements the moth.  I think I might like it better with a larger depth of field, though - i.e., if the front wing, at least, was also in focus.', '2009-01-01 04:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161865, 750083, 66635, '<td valign="top">Good framing.  I would be interested to see how it would look with a bit more saturation.  But it''s good work.</td>', 'Good framing.  I would be interested to see how it would look with a bit more saturation.  But it''s good work.', '2009-01-01 04:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161866, 749241, 66635, '<td valign="top">Poise is right.  However, because of the window behind the cat, you''ve got a contrast problem.  The highlights from the window are blown out and this also causes the cat to be too dark.  Then there is the kind of cluttered background.  These are meant to be constructive, though, not harsh.  I do like the bouquet.</td>', 'Poise is right.  However, because of the window behind the cat, you''ve got a contrast problem.  The highlights from the window are blown out and this also causes the cat to be too dark.  Then there is the kind of cluttered background.  These are meant to be constructive, though, not harsh.  I do like the bouquet.', '2009-01-01 04:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161869, 748109, 66635, '<td valign="top">Good title.  Great color.  This is almost a fantastic shot.  His face is just a bit out of focus.  Had you managed to capture from his nose to his eyes in sharp focus I''d have given this a ten and hoped for a ribbon.</td>', 'Good title.  Great color.  This is almost a fantastic shot.  His face is just a bit out of focus.  Had you managed to capture from his nose to his eyes in sharp focus I''d have given this a ten and hoped for a ribbon.', '2009-01-01 04:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161870, 751675, 66635, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia.  I''m not sure what to make of this photo, though.</td>', 'I like the sepia.  I''m not sure what to make of this photo, though.', '2009-01-01 04:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161871, 748138, 66635, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Love the colors.</td>', 'Great picture.  Love the colors.', '2009-01-01 04:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161872, 749097, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2009-01-01 04:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161885, 749889, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice tines and a wonderful scene</td>', 'nice tines and a wonderful scene', '2009-01-01 04:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161886, 750405, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely light, dof and simplicity</td>', 'lovely light, dof and simplicity', '2009-01-01 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161887, 751422, 34938, '<td valign="top">perfect exposure...is that Charing Cross station in London??? nice work</td>', 'perfect exposure...is that Charing Cross station in London??? nice work', '2009-01-01 04:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5161888, 750609, 34938, '<td valign="top">the train has left a wonderful light trail...great light coming over the edge of the hill, well done 8</td>', 'the train has left a wonderful light trail...great light coming over the edge of the hill, well done 8', '2009-01-01 04:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
