(5162624, 746860, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed.  There''s a connection between the sole walker, who could be anyone, and the sun or moon, and it could be either, all graced by the elegance of the branches.</td>', 'Wonderfully composed.  There''s a connection between the sole walker, who could be anyone, and the sun or moon, and it could be either, all graced by the elegance of the branches.', '2009-01-01 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
