(5163373, 750493, 97166, '<td valign="top">In a world where time moved along a different path, the story of a King and his Elven Queen would unfold to reveal the destiny of a legend.  Born to a simple people, he would find himself entwined in a battle for a land on the edge of darkness. He would find himself put in control of a power over time that he didn''t understand, with the balance of the lives of an entire peoples resting on a struggle to learn and control that power.  <br/> <br/>Against him, not only time itself, but an evil that knew no mercy.  An evil that desired only destruction, death, and controlling the power wielded by the boy.  Chased endlessly by the minions of this evil force, and chased by time and destiny itself, he desperately sought to discover not only the secret of the ultimate weapon, but the secret of the hero that hid within himself.<br/> <br/>Could he master himself and this power, or would Evil reign over all the lands?</td>', 'In a world where time moved along a different path, the story of a King and his Elven Queen would unfold to reveal the destiny of a legend.  Born to a simple people, he would find himself entwined in a battle for a land on the edge of darkness. He would find himself put in control of a power over time that he didn''t understand, with the balance of the lives of an entire peoples resting on a struggle to learn and control that power.   Against him, not only time itself, but an evil that knew no mercy.  An evil that desired only destruction, death, and controlling the power wielded by the boy.  Chased endlessly by the minions of this evil force, and chased by time and destiny itself, he desperately sought to discover not only the secret of the ultimate weapon, but the secret of the hero that hid within himself. Could he master himself and this power, or would Evil reign over all the lands?', '2009-01-01 16:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163377, 750903, 39880, '<td valign="top">Wreck dives are always fun.  This is a great shot.  Diver up top, wreck lower and fading away.  Good work.</td>', 'Wreck dives are always fun.  This is a great shot.  Diver up top, wreck lower and fading away.  Good work.', '2009-01-01 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
