(5163412, 751082, 97166, '<td valign="top">After a bloody war that lasted decades, the evil that had spawned it had finally been subdued.  A band of warriors had finally brought the monster down, and the greatest sorcerers of the age worked to lock such evil in a prison that they thought could never be penetrated. <br/> <br/>For millenia, the evil rested in that prison, encased in iron, chains, and ice. There it stayed until it was utterly forgotten, and the magics that held it there began to fade. <br/> <br/>It was a time of peace and happiness in the world, where good and light prevailed.  It was a day of warmth and celebration, when that unnatural sound echoed through the land. The sound of a sheet of ice breaking. <br/> <br/>The sound of the failing of the bonds that held the monster.  <br/> <br/>The sound of the end of all of existence.</td>', 'After a bloody war that lasted decades, the evil that had spawned it had finally been subdued.  A band of warriors had finally brought the monster down, and the greatest sorcerers of the age worked to lock such evil in a prison that they thought could never be penetrated.  For millenia, the evil rested in that prison, encased in iron, chains, and ice. There it stayed until it was utterly forgotten, and the magics that held it there began to fade.  It was a time of peace and happiness in the world, where good and light prevailed.  It was a day of warmth and celebration, when that unnatural sound echoed through the land. The sound of a sheet of ice breaking.  The sound of the failing of the bonds that held the monster.   The sound of the end of all of existence.', '2009-01-01 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
