(5163423, 750997, 97166, '<td valign="top">He thought he''d heard something.  Walking out onto the patio, he looked around. Nothing was there. He stood for a moment and listened closely. Still nothing. Odd, he was certain he''d heard someone, or something, out here. Had been fairly positive.  Frowning a little, he took one last look over the edge, at the traffic below and shook his head before walking back inside and taking his position by the glass door, while his boss finished the deal.<br/> <br/>Outside, silently, Spider-Bug crawled back out from under the overhang. That had been a close one, but it was time to finish this...</td>', 'He thought he''d heard something.  Walking out onto the patio, he looked around. Nothing was there. He stood for a moment and listened closely. Still nothing. Odd, he was certain he''d heard someone, or something, out here. Had been fairly positive.  Frowning a little, he took one last look over the edge, at the traffic below and shook his head before walking back inside and taking his position by the glass door, while his boss finished the deal. Outside, silently, Spider-Bug crawled back out from under the overhang. That had been a close one, but it was time to finish this...', '2009-01-01 17:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
