(5164598, 750053, 14867, '<td valign="top">Low rated, sorry.<br/>The upper half is decent, though the sky is a bit blah and the centered horizon not attractive. Some clouds are visible, a gradient filter or even a selective burning could help a lot there. <br/> <br/>The main issue is the foreground, IMO: flat, without any line of other point of interest, it is really blocking the eye. <br/>A black and white with a lower horizon and a more contrasted sky could probably provide a much better image.</td>', 'Low rated, sorry.The upper half is decent, though the sky is a bit blah and the centered horizon not attractive. Some clouds are visible, a gradient filter or even a selective burning could help a lot there.  The main issue is the foreground, IMO: flat, without any line of other point of interest, it is really blocking the eye. A black and white with a lower horizon and a more contrasted sky could probably provide a much better image.', '2009-01-02 05:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
