(5165023, 750623, 89341, '<td valign="top">This is just bizarre, high key and really dark shadows on the people in the foreground .... I love it, I find my eye going between the different people and there are no other distractions to see what they are all doing, surfing, paddling, walking, holding hands ... there is so much in this shot yet there is so little! Well done.</td>', 'This is just bizarre, high key and really dark shadows on the people in the foreground .... I love it, I find my eye going between the different people and there are no other distractions to see what they are all doing, surfing, paddling, walking, holding hands ... there is so much in this shot yet there is so little! Well done.', '2009-01-02 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
