(5165769, 751763, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 7/7/7 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/5/8 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 6/6 <br/>Presentation: 7<br/>Total: 6.55 <br/>Vote: 7 <br/> <br/>Remarks: the technical marks are high here, because, IMHO, the lack of sharpness, tonal gradation and lustre support the ambience and energy of this remarkable image. Great jazz, strongest in challenge.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 7/7/7 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/5/8 Aesthetics/Technical: 6/6 Presentation: 7Total: 6.55 Vote: 7  Remarks: the technical marks are high here, because, IMHO, the lack of sharpness, tonal gradation and lustre support the ambience and energy of this remarkable image. Great jazz, strongest in challenge.', '2009-01-02 17:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
