(5165805, 751612, 14867, '<td valign="top">It''s great! I love their attitudes - and it''s a good photography too, excellent b&amp;w with a working centered composition.<br/>I have another, more personal reason to like this image: 20 years ago, I captured this image <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=752348" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/14867/120/752348.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/14867/120/752348.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/10000-14999/14867/120/752348.jpg"/></a> of my 2 daughters - it wasn''t a good photography but as you can see, their attitude was about the same.</td>', 'It''s great! I love their attitudes - and it''s a good photography too, excellent b&w with a working centered composition.I have another, more personal reason to like this image: 20 years ago, I captured this image  of my 2 daughters - it wasn''t a good photography but as you can see, their attitude was about the same.', '2009-01-02 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165815, 751876, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/7/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/7 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 6/7 <br/>Presentation:6 <br/>Total: 6.44 <br/>Vote: 7 <br/> <br/>Remarks: Oddly, this genre, in a straightforward sort of way, would draw dramatically low marks from me. The cliche, however, has been promoted to the level of parody in this astonishing photograph, and that, apparently, without any injury to innocence or, if you like, to the subject itself.<br/> <br/>Altogether a magical image well worth studying, even if only for the various tensions discovered, unified and celebrated here.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/7/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/7/7 Aesthetics/Technical: 6/7 Presentation:6 Total: 6.44 Vote: 7  Remarks: Oddly, this genre, in a straightforward sort of way, would draw dramatically low marks from me. The cliche, however, has been promoted to the level of parody in this astonishing photograph, and that, apparently, without any injury to innocence or, if you like, to the subject itself. Altogether a magical image well worth studying, even if only for the various tensions discovered, unified and celebrated here.', '2009-01-02 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165829, 750623, 99263, '<td valign="top">Unusual processing. I like the mood I get from this.</td>', 'Unusual processing. I like the mood I get from this.', '2009-01-02 18:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165852, 749684, 99263, '<td valign="top">I find this very confrontational and in bad taste to enter in a challenge like this.</td>', 'I find this very confrontational and in bad taste to enter in a challenge like this.', '2009-01-02 18:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165855, 751573, 99263, '<td valign="top">What an amazing looking little tike. Really very impish and quite an unusual looking baby. There''s somehow a very clever, knowing, mischievous look in those eyes.</td>', 'What an amazing looking little tike. Really very impish and quite an unusual looking baby. There''s somehow a very clever, knowing, mischievous look in those eyes.', '2009-01-02 18:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165859, 751428, 14867, '<td valign="top">Unusual between long exposure and frozen motion, but the result is rather pleasant.<br/>It lacks something though, probably something around or near the waterfall. <br/>As is, there is just water, it''s almost documentary.<br/>I see the beautiful contrast with the warm tones of a reflection in the upper left corner, and I wish to see a bit more of that reflection.<br/>Globally a fine work nevertheless</td>', 'Unusual between long exposure and frozen motion, but the result is rather pleasant.It lacks something though, probably something around or near the waterfall. As is, there is just water, it''s almost documentary.I see the beautiful contrast with the warm tones of a reflection in the upper left corner, and I wish to see a bit more of that reflection.Globally a fine work nevertheless', '2009-01-02 18:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165863, 748996, 99263, '<td valign="top">Unusual effect</td>', 'Unusual effect', '2009-01-02 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165884, 750923, 92577, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>It''s St. Martin isn''t it?<br/>Astounding!<br/>Will look good in your portfolio</td>', ' It''s St. Martin isn''t it?Astounding!Will look good in your portfolio', '2009-01-02 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165900, 749684, 23002, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will end up with a new personal high for comments.  I hope you find it worth it.  I find this to be totally disgusting, and it has no photographic value at all.  It is simply entered to shock and get a reaction. <br/> <br/>I feel bad for the poor animal. :(</td>', 'I am sure you will end up with a new personal high for comments.  I hope you find it worth it.  I find this to be totally disgusting, and it has no photographic value at all.  It is simply entered to shock and get a reaction.  I feel bad for the poor animal. :(', '2009-01-02 19:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165928, 751840, 89341, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great shot, the exposure is perfect. The detail and colour in the sky and sand are great and the guy by the fire is the icing on the cake</td>', 'Wow, what a great shot, the exposure is perfect. The detail and colour in the sky and sand are great and the guy by the fire is the icing on the cake', '2009-01-02 19:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165942, 751612, 52130, '<td valign="top">great capture. I''m actually a fan of photos of upset children (not that I want them to be sad though) because it shows such emotion. great job</td>', 'great capture. I''m actually a fan of photos of upset children (not that I want them to be sad though) because it shows such emotion. great job', '2009-01-02 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165959, 751984, 100318, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this picture, so I am going to give it a 10. It definitely engages. So much so that I want to go sit down with this person and ask him where he has been and where he is going. <br/>Very cool....</td>', 'I keep coming back to this picture, so I am going to give it a 10. It definitely engages. So much so that I want to go sit down with this person and ask him where he has been and where he is going. Very cool....', '2009-01-02 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165969, 751621, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed but the highlights seem a bit overdone.</td>', 'Nicely composed but the highlights seem a bit overdone.', '2009-01-02 19:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165993, 751694, 100761, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge. Stunning work!</td>', 'My favorite of this challenge. Stunning work!', '2009-01-02 20:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165996, 751955, 18197, '<td valign="top">The scene feels a little flat to me and there are artifacts around the sun (moon?) that bother me. I don''t mind the lens flair but there seems to be a dark circle that corresponds roughly to the diameter of the rays.</td>', 'The scene feels a little flat to me and there are artifacts around the sun (moon?) that bother me. I don''t mind the lens flair but there seems to be a dark circle that corresponds roughly to the diameter of the rays.', '2009-01-02 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5165997, 751914, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the selective lighting on your subject. It really draws your eye to the exact intended point.</td>', 'I love the selective lighting on your subject. It really draws your eye to the exact intended point.', '2009-01-02 20:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166000, 751910, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the ground. Interesting lines. But for me personally, not a very interesting subject.</td>', 'Nice texture on the ground. Interesting lines. But for me personally, not a very interesting subject.', '2009-01-02 20:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166003, 751937, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your subject is nicely separated from the background. You can clearly see the musculature of the horse and the texture of its coat. These are pleasing, but the subject isn''t one that holds my attention for long.</td>', 'Your subject is nicely separated from the background. You can clearly see the musculature of the horse and the texture of its coat. These are pleasing, but the subject isn''t one that holds my attention for long.', '2009-01-02 20:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166014, 750456, 18197, '<td valign="top">Exceptional photo. Great to have a foreground subject in what would otherwise be a less interesting seascape. Sand/beach color is nicely complimentary with the break and ocean beyond. Texture of the wind blown break and the water there are neat. Well done.</td>', 'Exceptional photo. Great to have a foreground subject in what would otherwise be a less interesting seascape. Sand/beach color is nicely complimentary with the break and ocean beyond. Texture of the wind blown break and the water there are neat. Well done.', '2009-01-02 20:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166019, 751874, 18197, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the most original photos in the challenge and more interesting for its originality. Thanks for taking a risk with it.</td>', 'This has to be one of the most original photos in the challenge and more interesting for its originality. Thanks for taking a risk with it.', '2009-01-02 20:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166021, 751376, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice job catching the reflections. Scater is a positive compositional element. Would like to see more of the scater.</td>', 'Nice job catching the reflections. Scater is a positive compositional element. Would like to see more of the scater.', '2009-01-02 20:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166022, 748751, 42013, '<td valign="top">This version looks great too! I like the context. Good luck!</td>', 'This version looks great too! I like the context. Good luck!', '2009-01-02 20:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166023, 751900, 18197, '<td valign="top">Vry flat. Doesn''t do your subject justice.</td>', 'Vry flat. Doesn''t do your subject justice.', '2009-01-02 20:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166033, 751518, 18197, '<td valign="top">Exceptional photo. Colors are terrific, composition, focus, catchlights, ... I could go on. Truly professional grade. However, this belongs to a school of artificial perfection which I don''t particularly care for. Either pre-processing (makeup) or post-processing (smoothing and healing)of your model''s skin is too perfect to be believable. A china doll, so to speak. This is my issue, so don''t let it trouble you. Your''s is an incredible photo and I''m giving it a good score.</td>', 'Exceptional photo. Colors are terrific, composition, focus, catchlights, ... I could go on. Truly professional grade. However, this belongs to a school of artificial perfection which I don''t particularly care for. Either pre-processing (makeup) or post-processing (smoothing and healing)of your model''s skin is too perfect to be believable. A china doll, so to speak. This is my issue, so don''t let it trouble you. Your''s is an incredible photo and I''m giving it a good score.', '2009-01-02 20:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166035, 745542, 18197, '<td valign="top">Must be a foggy day :)  Nicely imagined and executed. Good management of light levels. What''s that on her foot, a tattoo? Think I''d clone that away.</td>', 'Must be a foggy day :)  Nicely imagined and executed. Good management of light levels. What''s that on her foot, a tattoo? Think I''d clone that away.', '2009-01-02 20:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166037, 751663, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Makes me want to be there. It seems to have a color cast to it (especially the snow) that might be imroved by warming it up just a little.</td>', 'Pretty. Makes me want to be there. It seems to have a color cast to it (especially the snow) that might be imroved by warming it up just a little.', '2009-01-02 20:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166038, 749697, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels like I''m in a helicopter banking hard into the turn. Kind of like it. Very clearly focused. Tilt works well.</td>', 'Feels like I''m in a helicopter banking hard into the turn. Kind of like it. Very clearly focused. Tilt works well.', '2009-01-02 20:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166040, 751905, 18197, '<td valign="top">I can''t find anything really well focused for my eye to come to rest on. A sharp focus on "something" would have helped this.</td>', 'I can''t find anything really well focused for my eye to come to rest on. A sharp focus on "something" would have helped this.', '2009-01-02 20:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166043, 751671, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Fenceline is a nice touch. Horizon cuts the photo almost exactly in half. Try moving it up or down just a little.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Fenceline is a nice touch. Horizon cuts the photo almost exactly in half. Try moving it up or down just a little.', '2009-01-02 20:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166047, 750060, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject and point of view. I like that you''ve included some foreground rock and snow. Focus and clarity are very good. But there''s a distracting optical illusion here. The light rocks in the background  "appear" to be in front of the darker rock of the arch. It really bothers me.</td>', 'Very nice subject and point of view. I like that you''ve included some foreground rock and snow. Focus and clarity are very good. But there''s a distracting optical illusion here. The light rocks in the background  "appear" to be in front of the darker rock of the arch. It really bothers me.', '2009-01-02 20:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166048, 751659, 86379, '<td valign="top">creepy but cool :) nice use of color.</td>', 'creepy but cool :) nice use of color.', '2009-01-02 20:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166050, 751750, 18197, '<td valign="top">He''s got history written in every line of his face. Great capture and presentation.</td>', 'He''s got history written in every line of his face. Great capture and presentation.', '2009-01-02 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166051, 751626, 86379, '<td valign="top">i like the story this tells.  nicely captured.</td>', 'i like the story this tells.  nicely captured.', '2009-01-02 20:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166055, 747720, 18197, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo in every respect except the title. I am generally not a fan of titles that detail post processing, or photographic technique. It feels like you''re afraid to let the photo stand on its own.</td>', 'A lovely photo in every respect except the title. I am generally not a fan of titles that detail post processing, or photographic technique. It feels like you''re afraid to let the photo stand on its own.', '2009-01-02 20:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166057, 748336, 86379, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2009-01-02 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166058, 751838, 86379, '<td valign="top">wow great job with this! excellent macro. the water droplets look really cool and add interest.</td>', 'wow great job with this! excellent macro. the water droplets look really cool and add interest.', '2009-01-02 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166062, 751612, 86379, '<td valign="top">the b&amp;w works great with this! and while i hate to see her upset, it adds so much to the shot. very cute!</td>', 'the b&w works great with this! and while i hate to see her upset, it adds so much to the shot. very cute!', '2009-01-02 20:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166066, 750340, 86379, '<td valign="top">wow what a cool shot! i''d like to see the white spot in the top left and the 2 spots at the bottom right removed, but other than that, great job with this :)</td>', 'wow what a cool shot! i''d like to see the white spot in the top left and the 2 spots at the bottom right removed, but other than that, great job with this :)', '2009-01-02 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166069, 751716, 86379, '<td valign="top">nice symmetry</td>', 'nice symmetry', '2009-01-02 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
