(5166074, 751849, 18197, '<td valign="top">The high contrast of this against dark background is dramatic and attention grabbing. But the exposure is so hot, I can''t see detail I''d like to linger over.</td>', 'The high contrast of this against dark background is dramatic and attention grabbing. But the exposure is so hot, I can''t see detail I''d like to linger over.', '2009-01-02 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
