(5166473, 750464, 77196, '<td valign="top">The ugly roof tops in the foreground draw my eye away from the very nice skyline and sky.</td>', 'The ugly roof tops in the foreground draw my eye away from the very nice skyline and sky.', '2009-01-02 23:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166482, 751895, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the crop kills it for me. The problem is that this crop has two subjects - the beautiful mountain and some weird jet trails and clouds in the sky. Even worse, the jet trails &amp; clouds are visually stronger than the mountain, and draw my focus to them. IIWMP (If It Were My Photo) I''d crop right side between the two tall trees, and maybe just a shade more off the left side. Top/bottom would then depend on what the shot needed for balance and layout - it might tolerate losing some sky, and some foreground (like up to the rust colored plants).</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the crop kills it for me. The problem is that this crop has two subjects - the beautiful mountain and some weird jet trails and clouds in the sky. Even worse, the jet trails & clouds are visually stronger than the mountain, and draw my focus to them. IIWMP (If It Were My Photo) I''d crop right side between the two tall trees, and maybe just a shade more off the left side. Top/bottom would then depend on what the shot needed for balance and layout - it might tolerate losing some sky, and some foreground (like up to the rust colored plants).', '2009-01-03 00:02:45.000000', NULL, 1);
