(5166763, 751675, 14867, '<td valign="top">Rather unexpected and daring subject amongst a FS-challenge, I appreciate how  a few elements admirably composed are evoking a whole story.<br/>Perfect exposure, emphasizing just what was needed.<br/>Nitpicking though: the crop is a bit tight on left side (I assume it''s not actually a crop, but that your lens wasn''t wide enough)</td>', 'Rather unexpected and daring subject amongst a FS-challenge, I appreciate how  a few elements admirably composed are evoking a whole story.Perfect exposure, emphasizing just what was needed.Nitpicking though: the crop is a bit tight on left side (I assume it''s not actually a crop, but that your lens wasn''t wide enough)', '2009-01-03 03:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166768, 749983, 97893, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Nicely composed and story-full.9.<br/> <br/>If I have to nit-pick, there is one small thing: The right hand just goes out of picture. including it would (perhaps) have even made the picture stronger. Just, not sure.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Nicely composed and story-full.9. If I have to nit-pick, there is one small thing: The right hand just goes out of picture. including it would (perhaps) have even made the picture stronger. Just, not sure.', '2009-01-03 03:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
