(5167255, 751992, 14867, '<td valign="top">Very, very well done. Particularly the motion of the snow flakes. The blue toning adds to the cold feeling and the vignette emphasizes cleverly the perspective.<br/>The table, of course, is a particularly good point of interest, making the image a bit surreal and really attractive.</td>', 'Very, very well done. Particularly the motion of the snow flakes. The blue toning adds to the cold feeling and the vignette emphasizes cleverly the perspective.The table, of course, is a particularly good point of interest, making the image a bit surreal and really attractive.', '2009-01-03 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167266, 751995, 14867, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the red building in this white world, and the composition using the fence as a leading line is rather good.<br/>Perhaps a bit overexposed or over-contrasted in the foreground - it still adds to the storm feeling, but it makes locally the image unclear (no visible limit between the snow above the fence and those in the background, for example)</td>', 'I like the contrast of the red building in this white world, and the composition using the fence as a leading line is rather good.Perhaps a bit overexposed or over-contrasted in the foreground - it still adds to the storm feeling, but it makes locally the image unclear (no visible limit between the snow above the fence and those in the background, for example)', '2009-01-03 09:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167267, 750996, 14867, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, and a pleasant graphic subject</td>', 'Excellent lighting, and a pleasant graphic subject', '2009-01-03 09:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167280, 751395, 14867, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, but between two genres: too much in the image for something minimalistic, not enough for a seascape. <br/>The horizon is strictly @ 2/3, but with such a empty sky, it could be 3/4.<br/>Nice to look at though.</td>', 'Not bad at all, but between two genres: too much in the image for something minimalistic, not enough for a seascape. The horizon is strictly @ 2/3, but with such a empty sky, it could be 3/4.Nice to look at though.', '2009-01-03 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
