(5167876, 751557, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflections and I like the high contrast. Makes me want to be snowshoeing through these woods. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely reflections and I like the high contrast. Makes me want to be snowshoeing through these woods. Well done.', '2009-01-03 14:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167878, 751881, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not your everyday challenge entry. I wouldn''t expect to like it based on subject matter, but I find myself drawn into the photo. A great study in texture.</td>', 'Not your everyday challenge entry. I wouldn''t expect to like it based on subject matter, but I find myself drawn into the photo. A great study in texture.', '2009-01-03 14:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167889, 751389, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught the emotion off a pleasant moment. Good work.</td>', 'You''ve caught the emotion off a pleasant moment. Good work.', '2009-01-03 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167891, 751979, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset. Cloud detail is very nice.</td>', 'Lovely sunset. Cloud detail is very nice.', '2009-01-03 14:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167893, 749815, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love this. Maybe best in show. High contrast is appealing. Colors are subtle and they blend well together. Hope you''ll share you you caught it and processed it.</td>', 'I love this. Maybe best in show. High contrast is appealing. Colors are subtle and they blend well together. Hope you''ll share you you caught it and processed it.', '2009-01-03 14:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167894, 745119, 18197, '<td valign="top">A technically accomplished photo of a subject that fails to hold my interest.</td>', 'A technically accomplished photo of a subject that fails to hold my interest.', '2009-01-03 14:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167896, 750902, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject and presentation doesn''t do anything for me, personally. Still there is something here that tries to grab my attention ... but I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Subject and presentation doesn''t do anything for me, personally. Still there is something here that tries to grab my attention ... but I can''t put my finger on it.', '2009-01-03 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167897, 749541, 18197, '<td valign="top">I tend to like high contrast photos and this is no exception. Nice patterns inthe ice. The mystery of the photo makes me want to linger and figure out what I''m seeing. Maybe a tighter crop on the ice would make it even better.</td>', 'I tend to like high contrast photos and this is no exception. Nice patterns inthe ice. The mystery of the photo makes me want to linger and figure out what I''m seeing. Maybe a tighter crop on the ice would make it even better.', '2009-01-03 14:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167899, 746705, 18197, '<td valign="top">An arresting expression you''ve captured here ... very focused. I like it.</td>', 'An arresting expression you''ve captured here ... very focused. I like it.', '2009-01-03 14:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167900, 748298, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty girls well captured. Nice presentation of the eyes. Good composition.</td>', 'Pretty girls well captured. Nice presentation of the eyes. Good composition.', '2009-01-03 14:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167902, 747296, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat capture of the caterpiller. Would love to hold it in my hand and play with it. Well done.</td>', 'Neat capture of the caterpiller. Would love to hold it in my hand and play with it. Well done.', '2009-01-03 14:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167906, 749679, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo. You''ve managed the perfect DOF for the subject. Clarity and focus are wonderful. Choice of B&amp;W was inspired. Among best of show.</td>', 'Fabulous photo. You''ve managed the perfect DOF for the subject. Clarity and focus are wonderful. Choice of B&W was inspired. Among best of show.', '2009-01-03 15:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167908, 749797, 18197, '<td valign="top">Workmanlike photo of a dull subject, partially rescued by the humor of the momment.</td>', 'Workmanlike photo of a dull subject, partially rescued by the humor of the momment.', '2009-01-03 15:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167912, 750176, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, focus and clarity. Feels slightly over exposed.</td>', 'Nice composition, focus and clarity. Feels slightly over exposed.', '2009-01-03 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167914, 751986, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of an intimate moment. Composition emphasizes the best elements of the photo.</td>', 'Nice capture of an intimate moment. Composition emphasizes the best elements of the photo.', '2009-01-03 15:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167917, 747429, 18197, '<td valign="top">Centered composition works pretty well here. A pleasant photo of a pleasant place.</td>', 'Centered composition works pretty well here. A pleasant photo of a pleasant place.', '2009-01-03 15:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167920, 750172, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cats are hard! Your capture and presentation here are exceptional. What''s your secret for getting cats to hold still, or at least look like they are?</td>', 'Cats are hard! Your capture and presentation here are exceptional. What''s your secret for getting cats to hold still, or at least look like they are?', '2009-01-03 15:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167921, 751199, 18197, '<td valign="top">Technically superb. Well composed, captured and presented. An interesting take or the ever popular bug macro.</td>', 'Technically superb. Well composed, captured and presented. An interesting take or the ever popular bug macro.', '2009-01-03 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167929, 751595, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. I like the way you''ve presented this and I love the sky. I might have cropped it just a little tighter on the left but it''s a judgement call. Well done.</td>', 'Aptly titled. I like the way you''ve presented this and I love the sky. I might have cropped it just a little tighter on the left but it''s a judgement call. Well done.', '2009-01-03 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167932, 751861, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well composed, captured and presented but I find I''m tiring of tiger photos.</td>', 'Well composed, captured and presented but I find I''m tiring of tiger photos.', '2009-01-03 15:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167937, 750640, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the way the fence line leads me into the photo. Subtle lighting and colors are very nice. More sky than you need but it establishes context.</td>', 'Love the way the fence line leads me into the photo. Subtle lighting and colors are very nice. More sky than you need but it establishes context.', '2009-01-03 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167941, 751911, 18197, '<td valign="top">Photo''s okay I guess, but feels like a tourist attraction snap. Sorry to be so direct. A bit more contrast and a bit of background bluring might have improved it.</td>', 'Photo''s okay I guess, but feels like a tourist attraction snap. Sorry to be so direct. A bit more contrast and a bit of background bluring might have improved it.', '2009-01-03 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167946, 745164, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is great. I love the subject. The perspective is interesting. Colors grab my attention (although they are almost too much). All in all, a superb photo!</td>', 'This is great. I love the subject. The perspective is interesting. Colors grab my attention (although they are almost too much). All in all, a superb photo!', '2009-01-03 15:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167951, 745348, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of B&amp;W. Composition might have been improved with a slightly tighter crop on the left. I like that you included his hands. Really improves the interest of the whole photo.</td>', 'I like the choice of B&W. Composition might have been improved with a slightly tighter crop on the left. I like that you included his hands. Really improves the interest of the whole photo.', '2009-01-03 15:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167958, 751717, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Focus and clarity of the water texture is very good. The framing of the pier as it moves away from you is interesting. Centered comp works well. Colors are good. Even the square crop works well here. Very well done.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Focus and clarity of the water texture is very good. The framing of the pier as it moves away from you is interesting. Centered comp works well. Colors are good. Even the square crop works well here. Very well done.', '2009-01-03 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167961, 751720, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the two diagonals crossing each other. A bit more contrast here might have improved this. Subject doesn''t interest me, personally.</td>', 'Good composition with the two diagonals crossing each other. A bit more contrast here might have improved this. Subject doesn''t interest me, personally.', '2009-01-03 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167965, 746854, 18197, '<td valign="top">A really nice photo. Among my favorites for this challenge. Dramatic sky juxtaposed with the simple, bare, lone tree is pleasing. Catching the bird in flight was a bonus. Not so much a fan of the letter box framing, but it doesn''t hurt you here.</td>', 'A really nice photo. Among my favorites for this challenge. Dramatic sky juxtaposed with the simple, bare, lone tree is pleasing. Catching the bird in flight was a bonus. Not so much a fan of the letter box framing, but it doesn''t hurt you here.', '2009-01-03 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167970, 750340, 18197, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting graphic design with lots of energy. Processing leaves me guessing whether you photographed a musician or a neon sign.</td>', 'It''s an interesting graphic design with lots of energy. Processing leaves me guessing whether you photographed a musician or a neon sign.', '2009-01-03 15:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167976, 751439, 18197, '<td valign="top">A very pleasant Currier &amp; Ives style photo. Very well done in terms of subject choice, composition, capture and presentation. There seems to be some haloing around the tree line, but it could be natural. Be careful of that as you do your post processing.</td>', 'A very pleasant Currier & Ives style photo. Very well done in terms of subject choice, composition, capture and presentation. There seems to be some haloing around the tree line, but it could be natural. Be careful of that as you do your post processing.', '2009-01-03 15:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167977, 747373, 18197, '<td valign="top">There''s got to be a great back story here. Photo makes me wonder about that.</td>', 'There''s got to be a great back story here. Photo makes me wonder about that.', '2009-01-03 15:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167981, 750933, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly extracted all the detail available in the penguins. The shallow DOF contrasts nicely with bird details. Not fond of the title.</td>', 'You''ve certainly extracted all the detail available in the penguins. The shallow DOF contrasts nicely with bird details. Not fond of the title.', '2009-01-03 15:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167983, 751570, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty models well captured. Nice eye treatment. Very good focus and DOF. But without knowing them or having some afinity with them, it may be less interesting to me than to you.</td>', 'Pretty models well captured. Nice eye treatment. Very good focus and DOF. But without knowing them or having some afinity with them, it may be less interesting to me than to you.', '2009-01-03 15:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167986, 749823, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see the anatomy of the web.</td>', 'Interesting to see the anatomy of the web.', '2009-01-03 15:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167989, 751997, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the subject and the processing. Very Currier &amp; Ives.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the subject and the processing. Very Currier & Ives.', '2009-01-03 15:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167993, 744914, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m a biker and inclined to like photos like this. The composition with the placement of the rider and the conformation of the road is interesting. Not fond of the letterbox framing, especiall when the frame consumes 1/3 of the frame.</td>', 'I''m a biker and inclined to like photos like this. The composition with the placement of the rider and the conformation of the road is interesting. Not fond of the letterbox framing, especiall when the frame consumes 1/3 of the frame.', '2009-01-03 15:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5167995, 750903, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m a diver and would love to be here when you shot this. Lighting is great. Subject won''t appeal to everyone but you caught me.</td>', 'I''m a diver and would love to be here when you shot this. Lighting is great. Subject won''t appeal to everyone but you caught me.', '2009-01-03 15:33:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5167998, 751443, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. An interesting, stark, photo. I wonder if it would be better with sharper focus, or possibly by softening the focus further?</td>', 'Aptly titled. An interesting, stark, photo. I wonder if it would be better with sharper focus, or possibly by softening the focus further?', '2009-01-03 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168000, 750432, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m a biker and I love this kind of photo. You did a brilliant job capturing details on the bike but the lighting is so bright you''ve lost the details in her face which would have given it a point or two more.</td>', 'I''m a biker and I love this kind of photo. You did a brilliant job capturing details on the bike but the lighting is so bright you''ve lost the details in her face which would have given it a point or two more.', '2009-01-03 15:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168002, 746860, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of the fog. Vignette works well. Very soft focus works well. Among my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely capture of the fog. Vignette works well. Very soft focus works well. Among my favorites for the challenge.', '2009-01-03 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168008, 751745, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this but it feels pretty dark on my calibrated monitor. Vignette gives it a somber feeling which will appeal to many. Nice capture of the motion and the nature of the ice.</td>', 'I like this but it feels pretty dark on my calibrated monitor. Vignette gives it a somber feeling which will appeal to many. Nice capture of the motion and the nature of the ice.', '2009-01-03 15:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168010, 750081, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this (Gasworks?). Focus is pretty soft overall.</td>', 'Interesting take on this (Gasworks?). Focus is pretty soft overall.', '2009-01-03 15:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168013, 748877, 18197, '<td valign="top">Dubai does Blade Runner? It''s certainly not the image the tourist bureau wants you to have. Thanks for the refreshing perspective.</td>', 'Dubai does Blade Runner? It''s certainly not the image the tourist bureau wants you to have. Thanks for the refreshing perspective.', '2009-01-03 15:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168015, 751213, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, good contrast, overly soft on the focus for my taste.</td>', 'Nice subject, good contrast, overly soft on the focus for my taste.', '2009-01-03 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168029, 749385, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''ve nicely captured the floing water.</td>', 'You''ve nicely captured the floing water.', '2009-01-03 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168032, 751960, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have tried photographing jellyfish before and they are HARD to capture. Very well done here! Composition is terrific. Focus, texture, color ... everything ... well done!</td>', 'I have tried photographing jellyfish before and they are HARD to capture. Very well done here! Composition is terrific. Focus, texture, color ... everything ... well done!', '2009-01-03 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168041, 751618, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition, the focus, the vignette but the subject doesn''t hold me.</td>', 'I like the overall composition, the focus, the vignette but the subject doesn''t hold me.', '2009-01-03 15:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168052, 749386, 18197, '<td valign="top">A somber winter day doesn''t feel very wonderland-like. Still it makes me want to be there, possibly snowshoeing past this brook.</td>', 'A somber winter day doesn''t feel very wonderland-like. Still it makes me want to be there, possibly snowshoeing past this brook.', '2009-01-03 15:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168057, 751403, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well imagined, captured and presented. Sky contrast is pleasing. Not fond of the letterbox framing.</td>', 'Well imagined, captured and presented. Sky contrast is pleasing. Not fond of the letterbox framing.', '2009-01-03 15:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168061, 751614, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is great! What a neat capture of this monster wave! I could stand where you are standing and watch this all day!</td>', 'Wow, this is great! What a neat capture of this monster wave! I could stand where you are standing and watch this all day!', '2009-01-03 15:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168074, 750806, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sometimes what you can''t see makes a photo more appealing. This photo demonstrates this in spades. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes what you can''t see makes a photo more appealing. This photo demonstrates this in spades. Well done.', '2009-01-03 15:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168076, 751700, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pleasant image. I like the high contrast.</td>', 'Pleasant image. I like the high contrast.', '2009-01-03 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168080, 751778, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of a seemingly candid moment. She''s got mischief in her eyes and smile. Good job catching that.</td>', 'Very nice capture of a seemingly candid moment. She''s got mischief in her eyes and smile. Good job catching that.', '2009-01-03 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168085, 751902, 18197, '<td valign="top">Yum. Food is hard to capture well but you''ve nailed it here. Among my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'Yum. Food is hard to capture well but you''ve nailed it here. Among my favorites for the challenge.', '2009-01-03 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168086, 750609, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. Nice sky tones. Nice capture of the moving train. Leading lines work well. Good job.</td>', 'Aptly titled. Nice sky tones. Nice capture of the moving train. Leading lines work well. Good job.', '2009-01-03 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168089, 751963, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the light here, and the tones, and the reflections, ... In short, among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'I love the light here, and the tones, and the reflections, ... In short, among my favorites this challenge.', '2009-01-03 16:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168091, 751725, 18197, '<td valign="top">A pleasant Currier &amp; Ives moment. May be just a bit over exposed.</td>', 'A pleasant Currier & Ives moment. May be just a bit over exposed.', '2009-01-03 16:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168093, 748843, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty setting. Nice sky. Sepia works well. Good job.</td>', 'Pretty setting. Nice sky. Sepia works well. Good job.', '2009-01-03 16:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168096, 748061, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cool. You''ve caught the instant of ignition perfectly.  Won''t appeal to everbody but appeals to me. Among my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'Cool. You''ve caught the instant of ignition perfectly.  Won''t appeal to everbody but appeals to me. Among my favorites for this challenge.', '2009-01-03 16:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168097, 750162, 18197, '<td valign="top">The way you caught and presented this, the horse seems to have great intelligence ... almost like it is ready to offer life advice to the girl. I like that.</td>', 'The way you caught and presented this, the horse seems to have great intelligence ... almost like it is ready to offer life advice to the girl. I like that.', '2009-01-03 16:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168099, 751626, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. Well composed. Sharpest focus seems to be on the wine glass. If you shifted it to her face, it would be even better.</td>', 'Aptly titled. Well composed. Sharpest focus seems to be on the wine glass. If you shifted it to her face, it would be even better.', '2009-01-03 16:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168100, 745855, 18197, '<td valign="top">This gives the impression of tone mapping gone a little too far. It may be an optical illusion. Otherwise a nice photo of a nice setting. Wouldn''t mind sitting here awhile and soaking up the scene.</td>', 'This gives the impression of tone mapping gone a little too far. It may be an optical illusion. Otherwise a nice photo of a nice setting. Wouldn''t mind sitting here awhile and soaking up the scene.', '2009-01-03 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168102, 750083, 18197, '<td valign="top">A well imagined, captured and presented example of this now tiresome genre. Don''t worry, I gave it a good score, but it''s getting harder and harder to score tigers highly.</td>', 'A well imagined, captured and presented example of this now tiresome genre. Don''t worry, I gave it a good score, but it''s getting harder and harder to score tigers highly.', '2009-01-03 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168104, 751624, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the way the road leads me into this lovely scene. Not fond of letterbox framing, and even less so in portrait orientation.</td>', 'Love the way the road leads me into this lovely scene. Not fond of letterbox framing, and even less so in portrait orientation.', '2009-01-03 16:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168105, 751373, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very strong photo in every respect, but especially the composition, focus, color and clarity. Among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Very strong photo in every respect, but especially the composition, focus, color and clarity. Among my favorites this challenge.', '2009-01-03 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168110, 751949, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good execution of a photo with a high degree of difficulty. Nice crater detail along the terminator.</td>', 'Good execution of a photo with a high degree of difficulty. Nice crater detail along the terminator.', '2009-01-03 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168112, 745481, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pleasant photo of a pleasant place, but it''s not holding my attention.</td>', 'Pleasant photo of a pleasant place, but it''s not holding my attention.', '2009-01-03 16:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168113, 750796, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great sky. The rest lets me down a bit.</td>', 'Great sky. The rest lets me down a bit.', '2009-01-03 16:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168114, 750253, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the subject and how you''ve caught it at dawn(?). Among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Love the subject and how you''ve caught it at dawn(?). Among my favorites this challenge.', '2009-01-03 16:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168116, 746718, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Makes me want to be there!</td>', 'Beautiful. Makes me want to be there!', '2009-01-03 16:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168119, 751531, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl, well photographed. Lots to like, litle to quibble with. Good job.</td>', 'Pretty girl, well photographed. Lots to like, litle to quibble with. Good job.', '2009-01-03 16:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168121, 750531, 18197, '<td valign="top">Grew up in the Rockies. This feels like home to me. Nicely done.</td>', 'Grew up in the Rockies. This feels like home to me. Nicely done.', '2009-01-03 16:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168124, 747748, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject matter isn''t doing it for me. Wish the trees were out of the way so I could see the approaching storm.</td>', 'Subject matter isn''t doing it for me. Wish the trees were out of the way so I could see the approaching storm.', '2009-01-03 16:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168125, 747310, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the detail you''ve captured in the rigging. Exceptional.</td>', 'I love the detail you''ve captured in the rigging. Exceptional.', '2009-01-03 16:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168129, 750027, 18197, '<td valign="top">Best moon shot in the challenge. I really like the detail along the terminator. Moon shots are hard. Don''t believe me, just try a few hundred, or ask NASA. This succeeds brilliantly.</td>', 'Best moon shot in the challenge. I really like the detail along the terminator. Moon shots are hard. Don''t believe me, just try a few hundred, or ask NASA. This succeeds brilliantly.', '2009-01-03 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168133, 747584, 18197, '<td valign="top">This bird feels massive in the photo. I like the detail you''ve captured here and the colors. Shallow DOF works well too.</td>', 'This bird feels massive in the photo. I like the detail you''ve captured here and the colors. Shallow DOF works well too.', '2009-01-03 16:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168135, 749479, 18197, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a relatively uninteresting subject, but you''ve made the most of it. Vignette works well.</td>', 'For me, this is a relatively uninteresting subject, but you''ve made the most of it. Vignette works well.', '2009-01-03 16:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168137, 751933, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. Good that you caught a foreground subject. Next time try not to cut the frame in half with the horizon.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. Good that you caught a foreground subject. Next time try not to cut the frame in half with the horizon.', '2009-01-03 16:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168140, 745694, 18197, '<td valign="top">What an interesting character! Well photographed and presented.</td>', 'What an interesting character! Well photographed and presented.', '2009-01-03 16:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168144, 750369, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2009-01-03 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168150, 750838, 18197, '<td valign="top">It''s probably an optical illusion but it feels tilted to the left. I''m a nut about unintentional tilt and this bothers me a little. Otherwise an excellant photo.</td>', 'It''s probably an optical illusion but it feels tilted to the left. I''m a nut about unintentional tilt and this bothers me a little. Otherwise an excellant photo.', '2009-01-03 16:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168152, 749796, 18197, '<td valign="top">A somber photo aptly titled. I like the composition and the way you''ve captured and presented it. But it makes me sad.</td>', 'A somber photo aptly titled. I like the composition and the way you''ve captured and presented it. But it makes me sad.', '2009-01-03 16:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168180, 751999, 95137, '<td valign="top">What are these????</td>', 'What are these????', '2009-01-03 16:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168186, 751901, 99394, '<td valign="top">The guy on the top row.. green shirt.. roughly 4 or 5 over from the left.. looks like he pulled a butt cheek.. awesome :)</td>', 'The guy on the top row.. green shirt.. roughly 4 or 5 over from the left.. looks like he pulled a butt cheek.. awesome :)', '2009-01-03 16:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168187, 751747, 95137, '<td valign="top">Would work better with a tighter crop</td>', 'Would work better with a tighter crop', '2009-01-03 16:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168188, 749320, 99394, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture!</td>', 'beautiful picture!', '2009-01-03 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168193, 747584, 99394, '<td valign="top">Looks like the focus was on the beak.. would have loved it to be on the eyes. Still a great shot!</td>', 'Looks like the focus was on the beak.. would have loved it to be on the eyes. Still a great shot!', '2009-01-03 16:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168260, 749729, 64989, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and I like the processing in the face.  The distracting thing for me is the halos that show around santas head and shoulders, especially around the ball of his hat.</td>', 'Clever idea, and I like the processing in the face.  The distracting thing for me is the halos that show around santas head and shoulders, especially around the ball of his hat.', '2009-01-03 17:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168262, 747310, 64989, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, sharp, and I like the composition.</td>', 'Very nice shot, sharp, and I like the composition.', '2009-01-03 17:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168263, 750253, 64989, '<td valign="top">I like the line of shrubs leading up to the castle.  I draws my eye in nicely</td>', 'I like the line of shrubs leading up to the castle.  I draws my eye in nicely', '2009-01-03 17:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168266, 751507, 64989, '<td valign="top">This is very eye-catching.  The crispness and the sharpness really says "winter".  The berries are very saturaed, but I like it in opposition to the ice.</td>', 'This is very eye-catching.  The crispness and the sharpness really says "winter".  The berries are very saturaed, but I like it in opposition to the ice.', '2009-01-03 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168271, 751769, 64989, '<td valign="top">Good job conveying motion, and I like the inclusion of only the lower half of the body.</td>', 'Good job conveying motion, and I like the inclusion of only the lower half of the body.', '2009-01-03 17:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168273, 751874, 64989, '<td valign="top">Bad day to me a moth!  I like the colors and centered placement of the subject.</td>', 'Bad day to me a moth!  I like the colors and centered placement of the subject.', '2009-01-03 17:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168276, 746705, 64989, '<td valign="top">Overall a good shot, but as soon as I saw it I wished the eyes had been as sharp as the lips. (or sharper)</td>', 'Overall a good shot, but as soon as I saw it I wished the eyes had been as sharp as the lips. (or sharper)', '2009-01-03 17:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168280, 747373, 64989, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, the photographer and tatoo artist both did a lovely job.</td>', 'Very nice colors, the photographer and tatoo artist both did a lovely job.', '2009-01-03 17:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168284, 749983, 64989, '<td valign="top">Love the intensity in the boy''s eyes.  Technically wonderful and emotive.</td>', 'Love the intensity in the boy''s eyes.  Technically wonderful and emotive.', '2009-01-03 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168288, 751923, 64989, '<td valign="top">You just made me hungry.</td>', 'You just made me hungry.', '2009-01-03 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168300, 750060, 64989, '<td valign="top">I like the play of the orange/gold canyon walls against the blue skies and bluish snow.</td>', 'I like the play of the orange/gold canyon walls against the blue skies and bluish snow.', '2009-01-03 17:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168309, 750359, 64989, '<td valign="top">This one is a little bit off for me... The sparse limbs in the lower left are sharper than the rest, and there seems to be some evidence of heavy processing in the snow behind the center tree trunk.</td>', 'This one is a little bit off for me... The sparse limbs in the lower left are sharper than the rest, and there seems to be some evidence of heavy processing in the snow behind the center tree trunk.', '2009-01-03 18:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168317, 751160, 64989, '<td valign="top">The flare here is really overpowering... the location is lovely.</td>', 'The flare here is really overpowering... the location is lovely.', '2009-01-03 18:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168334, 750809, 66648, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2009-01-03 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168358, 748403, 43774, '<td valign="top">Winner? I hope so!!</td>', 'Winner? I hope so!!', '2009-01-03 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168381, 751407, 55956, '<td valign="top">why the bad inclination???'' could be fixed easly...</td>', 'why the bad inclination???'' could be fixed easly...', '2009-01-03 18:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168384, 744395, 55956, '<td valign="top">congrats, a great capture, the perspective could be fixed but isn''t really distracting, very good the black and white 8</td>', 'congrats, a great capture, the perspective could be fixed but isn''t really distracting, very good the black and white 8', '2009-01-03 19:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168387, 751612, 55956, '<td valign="top">how is sweet this photo...</td>', 'how is sweet this photo...', '2009-01-03 19:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168388, 751719, 55956, '<td valign="top">yes, securely a bella farfalla and well done the photograph.</td>', 'yes, securely a bella farfalla and well done the photograph.', '2009-01-03 19:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168393, 746252, 55956, '<td valign="top">great portrait(and self portrait....) the skin have a wonderful natural tone.</td>', 'great portrait(and self portrait....) the skin have a wonderful natural tone.', '2009-01-03 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168400, 751840, 55956, '<td valign="top">beautiful image.</td>', 'beautiful image.', '2009-01-03 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168404, 749684, 99394, '<td valign="top">... seriously disturbing...</td>', '... seriously disturbing...', '2009-01-03 19:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168407, 751659, 55956, '<td valign="top">a good image, as personal opinion another crop should be better. I think that a square crop adjust a bit the composition, the right side of the photo is unhelpful. 7</td>', 'a good image, as personal opinion another crop should be better. I think that a square crop adjust a bit the composition, the right side of the photo is unhelpful. 7', '2009-01-03 19:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5168427, 746718, 55956, '<td valign="top">something don''t work in this photograph but i don''t konw what is.</td>', 'something don''t work in this photograph but i don''t konw what is.', '2009-01-03 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
