(5169547, 748522, 81458, '<td valign="top">The colors are great, I would love to see more profile from the bird.</td>', 'The colors are great, I would love to see more profile from the bird.', '2009-01-04 06:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169548, 751954, 81458, '<td valign="top">Too much light, but a good sharpness. The eyes catch you.</td>', 'Too much light, but a good sharpness. The eyes catch you.', '2009-01-04 06:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169550, 751971, 81458, '<td valign="top">Just perfect !</td>', 'Just perfect !', '2009-01-04 06:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169551, 747573, 81458, '<td valign="top">Great focus point.</td>', 'Great focus point.', '2009-01-04 06:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169553, 750253, 81458, '<td valign="top">Superb light. Love the shadows.</td>', 'Superb light. Love the shadows.', '2009-01-04 06:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169556, 751716, 81458, '<td valign="top">Great composition, The lines draws you far away into the picture.</td>', 'Great composition, The lines draws you far away into the picture.', '2009-01-04 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169557, 751899, 81458, '<td valign="top">Great, Love it !</td>', 'Great, Love it !', '2009-01-04 06:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169558, 751883, 81458, '<td valign="top">Ummmm.. nothing to say !</td>', 'Ummmm.. nothing to say !', '2009-01-04 06:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169563, 744498, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the space on the left side and some on the top could be cropped off.  If that feels crowded, some more space on the right might open it up.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the space on the left side and some on the top could be cropped off.  If that feels crowded, some more space on the right might open it up.', '2009-01-04 06:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169565, 751613, 39430, '<td valign="top">Love the colours.  It might get marked down for being so dark (will show up differently on different monitors), but I love the feel of it.</td>', 'Love the colours.  It might get marked down for being so dark (will show up differently on different monitors), but I love the feel of it.', '2009-01-04 06:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169570, 751581, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp BW show, but it lacks a focus in the image.  The line of trees leads the eye to the right, away from the shelter.  Cropping off the right, and leaving in more snow at the bottom may help to balance the image better.</td>', 'Nice crisp BW show, but it lacks a focus in the image.  The line of trees leads the eye to the right, away from the shelter.  Cropping off the right, and leaving in more snow at the bottom may help to balance the image better.', '2009-01-04 06:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169573, 751617, 39430, '<td valign="top">You might get mixed reactions about that lens flare.  I think it is probably a better photo without it.  Other than that, a nice scene, possibly a little dark in the foreground and subject.</td>', 'You might get mixed reactions about that lens flare.  I think it is probably a better photo without it.  Other than that, a nice scene, possibly a little dark in the foreground and subject.', '2009-01-04 06:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169576, 751902, 39430, '<td valign="top">Something is missing here - I think the main light from behind is upsetting it a little, by casting shadows toward the front.</td>', 'Something is missing here - I think the main light from behind is upsetting it a little, by casting shadows toward the front.', '2009-01-04 06:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169577, 747228, 39430, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like MC Escher drawing.  :)</td>', 'Almost looks like MC Escher drawing.  :)', '2009-01-04 06:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169580, 751083, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the colours here, but the skewed composition is a little distracting.  Perhaps using the door as a more centred frame would be a better choice?</td>', 'I like the colours here, but the skewed composition is a little distracting.  Perhaps using the door as a more centred frame would be a better choice?', '2009-01-04 06:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169582, 751525, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''d crop just a touch off the left, so the black-bar is gone.</td>', 'Very nice.  I''d crop just a touch off the left, so the black-bar is gone.', '2009-01-04 06:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169583, 748404, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very cool portrait.  The light line across the top is a minor technical flaw, probably from sharpening after adding the border.  But that''s very minor.  Great job.</td>', 'Very cool portrait.  The light line across the top is a minor technical flaw, probably from sharpening after adding the border.  But that''s very minor.  Great job.', '2009-01-04 06:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169588, 751956, 39430, '<td valign="top">The orange cast in night photos is often difficult to fix, especially as some industrial lights are super-orange.  Even setting the camera to tungsten white balance won''t always fix it enough.  I like the idea of this shot, but the colours don''t work for me at all.  You can adjust the colours to some extent in Photoshop, and shooting RAW will give more leeway to adjust this.</td>', 'The orange cast in night photos is often difficult to fix, especially as some industrial lights are super-orange.  Even setting the camera to tungsten white balance won''t always fix it enough.  I like the idea of this shot, but the colours don''t work for me at all.  You can adjust the colours to some extent in Photoshop, and shooting RAW will give more leeway to adjust this.', '2009-01-04 07:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169590, 751871, 39430, '<td valign="top">It would improve the shot if the stone was bigger in the frame.  This would show more detail, and also allow the lines of the chain to complement the design of the stone, rather than distract from it.</td>', 'It would improve the shot if the stone was bigger in the frame.  This would show more detail, and also allow the lines of the chain to complement the design of the stone, rather than distract from it.', '2009-01-04 07:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169594, 750796, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I feel it would be improved with a closer crop, and possibly some less-dramatic editing.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I feel it would be improved with a closer crop, and possibly some less-dramatic editing.', '2009-01-04 07:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169602, 750230, 39430, '<td valign="top">I think I can just make out some graffiti on that pole...I think it says "Slippy was ''ere".  :)  (If you don''t know what I mean...<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=474856" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/631/120/474856.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/631/120/474856.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/631/120/474856.jpg"/></a>)</td>', 'I think I can just make out some graffiti on that pole...I think it says "Slippy was ''ere".  :)  (If you don''t know what I mean...)', '2009-01-04 07:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169606, 750923, 39430, '<td valign="top">Everyone''s going to cry photoshop on this one, but I saw this beach recently on You-Tube blowing people off the beach with the takeoff jet-blast.  Very cool shot!  :)</td>', 'Everyone''s going to cry photoshop on this one, but I saw this beach recently on You-Tube blowing people off the beach with the takeoff jet-blast.  Very cool shot!  :)', '2009-01-04 07:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169609, 750366, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The crooked horizon is a little distracting, and if the silhouette was a little better defined, it would improve the image.  The dark foreground is lost on a calibrated monitor - this image looks better on my uncalibrated monitor, where I can see the green grass, so I''ll vote on that monitor for you.  :)</td>', 'Nice shot.  The crooked horizon is a little distracting, and if the silhouette was a little better defined, it would improve the image.  The dark foreground is lost on a calibrated monitor - this image looks better on my uncalibrated monitor, where I can see the green grass, so I''ll vote on that monitor for you.  :)', '2009-01-04 07:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169611, 746718, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the colours.  It looks really dark on my calibrated monitor, but looks great on my other monitor.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the colours.  It looks really dark on my calibrated monitor, but looks great on my other monitor.', '2009-01-04 07:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169613, 751618, 39430, '<td valign="top">The vignette is a little strong, and I''d go for a closer crop.  Other than that, you have captured a nice street feel in your street photography here.</td>', 'The vignette is a little strong, and I''d go for a closer crop.  Other than that, you have captured a nice street feel in your street photography here.', '2009-01-04 07:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
