(5169637, 751840, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait. Is this in Wadi Rum? I am not sure I quite like the intense saturation of colours in sky and sand, they don''t seem very realistic. But I do like the composition, the fire flames and the motion of that stick/ poker he''s holding.</td>', 'A nice portrait. Is this in Wadi Rum? I am not sure I quite like the intense saturation of colours in sky and sand, they don''t seem very realistic. But I do like the composition, the fire flames and the motion of that stick/ poker he''s holding.', '2009-01-04 07:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
