(5169641, 744395, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an interesting juxtaposition! The high contrast black and white is perfect for the image. This really works for me.</td>', 'What an interesting juxtaposition! The high contrast black and white is perfect for the image. This really works for me.', '2009-01-04 07:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169644, 751443, 3087, '<td valign="top">The high contrast works very well, as does the way most of the image is so pale. I would like it even more were those dark fallen leaves in the foreground cloned out, though that may not be permitted in the ruleset, I don''t know. And perhaps you prefer the image with the imperfections of nature left in? Still, I like this a lot.</td>', 'The high contrast works very well, as does the way most of the image is so pale. I would like it even more were those dark fallen leaves in the foreground cloned out, though that may not be permitted in the ruleset, I don''t know. And perhaps you prefer the image with the imperfections of nature left in? Still, I like this a lot.', '2009-01-04 07:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169647, 751676, 39430, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for something different.  :)</td>', 'Bonus points for something different.  :)', '2009-01-04 07:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169651, 750456, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is wonderful! Great light on the wave, really bringing out the wonderful turquoise colours. Love the capture of the spray caught by the wind. And that yellow swathe of sand in the foreground contrasts nicely with the colours of the water and sky. Though I''d say the colours feel a touch too far saturated for my tastes. ANd of course, those almost silhouetted foreground observers add the perfect focal point, though they perhaps distract a little from the surfer in the sea.</td>', 'Wow, this is wonderful! Great light on the wave, really bringing out the wonderful turquoise colours. Love the capture of the spray caught by the wind. And that yellow swathe of sand in the foreground contrasts nicely with the colours of the water and sky. Though I''d say the colours feel a touch too far saturated for my tastes. ANd of course, those almost silhouetted foreground observers add the perfect focal point, though they perhaps distract a little from the surfer in the sea.', '2009-01-04 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169653, 750923, 83600, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2009-01-04 07:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
