(5171580, 751411, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this except that the sun is over exposed. Tough, though, in this situation to leep everything perfectly exposed.</td>', 'Love everything about this except that the sun is over exposed. Tough, though, in this situation to leep everything perfectly exposed.', '2009-01-04 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
