(5171799, 751706, 79357, '<td valign="top">Fantastic creature and photo! A little too much sharpening with a big radius</td>', 'Fantastic creature and photo! A little too much sharpening with a big radius', '2009-01-05 01:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171837, 750936, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a fantastic portrait!  The main thing that strikes me is the clarity of the image... I don''t know if that''s the right word but I feel as though the image is real and three dimentional and that I could step right into that world from my computer.  The colors are beautiful and complimentary to each other, the focus is superb, and the pose and gaze of the dog are perfect.  I love the background - I think it does a great job of enhancing the subject - and the way that the focus fades off in the background really engages me.  The only thing I question is the brown elements on the grass; I wonder if they are necessary, but I''m not sure the image would be better without them.  All in all a wonderful and amazing photo, one you should be very proud of.</td>', 'Wow, what a fantastic portrait!  The main thing that strikes me is the clarity of the image... I don''t know if that''s the right word but I feel as though the image is real and three dimentional and that I could step right into that world from my computer.  The colors are beautiful and complimentary to each other, the focus is superb, and the pose and gaze of the dog are perfect.  I love the background - I think it does a great job of enhancing the subject - and the way that the focus fades off in the background really engages me.  The only thing I question is the brown elements on the grass; I wonder if they are necessary, but I''m not sure the image would be better without them.  All in all a wonderful and amazing photo, one you should be very proud of.', '2009-01-05 01:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
