(5175423, 751758, 97166, '<td valign="top">A tilt of the head and a gaze to the sky,<br/>a head full of wonder and a dream in her eye.<br/>A smile on her face and one wonders why,<br/>what goes on in the mind of a child?<br/> <br/>A shrug very shyly, a toss of the hair,<br/>a kiss on your cheek she will bashfully share.<br/>A hug and a cuddle and a touch full of care,<br/>what a lot for the heart of a child.<br/> <br/>The loss of a pet that was her pride and her joy,<br/>a breaking of what was her favorite toy.<br/>Getting in trouble for kissing a boy,<br/>what a weight in the soul of a child.<br/> <br/>The learning and growing and laughing and play,<br/>the changes that happen on every foray,<br/>The happy and sad, which one for today?<br/>this is the life of a child.</td>', 'A tilt of the head and a gaze to the sky,a head full of wonder and a dream in her eye.A smile on her face and one wonders why,what goes on in the mind of a child? A shrug very shyly, a toss of the hair,a kiss on your cheek she will bashfully share.A hug and a cuddle and a touch full of care,what a lot for the heart of a child. The loss of a pet that was her pride and her joy,a breaking of what was her favorite toy.Getting in trouble for kissing a boy,what a weight in the soul of a child. The learning and growing and laughing and play,the changes that happen on every foray,The happy and sad, which one for today?this is the life of a child.', '2009-01-06 19:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175471, 751989, 18197, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is pretty flat with few shadows defining the hand (your apparent subject based on what you chose to focus on). A bit more contrast, or perhaps a little dodge and burn would have helped this for me.</td>', 'The lighting here is pretty flat with few shadows defining the hand (your apparent subject based on what you chose to focus on). A bit more contrast, or perhaps a little dodge and burn would have helped this for me.', '2009-01-06 19:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
