(5175678, 749637, 29011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm background. I like the shallow DOF but my only nitpick is that the body of the butterfly looks slightly oversharpened. Great shot overall.</td>', 'Beautiful warm background. I like the shallow DOF but my only nitpick is that the body of the butterfly looks slightly oversharpened. Great shot overall.', '2009-01-06 20:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
