(5176009, 751434, 42495, '<td valign="top">Back for bump and comment - another example of beautiy in the simple.</td>', 'Back for bump and comment - another example of beautiy in the simple.', '2009-01-06 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5176010, 751612, 97166, '<td valign="top">He looked at her, and he sighed, and he wondered how he ever wanted one of these.  He''d begged for a baby sister. Tommy had had one and he loved her so, and at first it had been really great.  <br/> <br/>He had held her and hugged her and kissed her and she mostly just slept and looked cute and everyone told him what a great big brother he was.<br/> <br/>He looked at her, and he sighed.  Why couldn''t she just be happy? This was taking too long and he wanted to play Wii, and she just.. wouldn''t.. stop.<br/> <br/>He wondered why he ever wanted one of these.</td>', 'He looked at her, and he sighed, and he wondered how he ever wanted one of these.  He''d begged for a baby sister. Tommy had had one and he loved her so, and at first it had been really great.   He had held her and hugged her and kissed her and she mostly just slept and looked cute and everyone told him what a great big brother he was. He looked at her, and he sighed.  Why couldn''t she just be happy? This was taking too long and he wanted to play Wii, and she just.. wouldn''t.. stop. He wondered why he ever wanted one of these.', '2009-01-06 22:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5176025, 750874, 42495, '<td valign="top">Back for a bump and comment.  At first this looked like a simple snapshot, but then I could stop staring at it.  This reminds me of a child and fishing pole in simpler times wasting away a warm summer day.  Yet it''s obviously not a child or summer, but perhaps he''s remembering those times also.  There''s just something special about this.</td>', 'Back for a bump and comment.  At first this looked like a simple snapshot, but then I could stop staring at it.  This reminds me of a child and fishing pole in simpler times wasting away a warm summer day.  Yet it''s obviously not a child or summer, but perhaps he''s remembering those times also.  There''s just something special about this.', '2009-01-06 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
