(5177095, 751763, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is weirdly compelling.  He appears to be dancing in the dust.  Makes no sense, and all the better for that too.  Very nice, entertaining photograph.</td>', 'This is weirdly compelling.  He appears to be dancing in the dust.  Makes no sense, and all the better for that too.  Very nice, entertaining photograph.', '2009-01-07 05:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
