(5177130, 751921, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such a startling sight, snugged in alongside all this savage geometry.  There even appears (as your title suggests) to be a cutout for the nose.  Many will be sentimental about this, but the animal is in quite good condition; just cold.  It''s a good and unusual photograph.</td>', 'Such a startling sight, snugged in alongside all this savage geometry.  There even appears (as your title suggests) to be a cutout for the nose.  Many will be sentimental about this, but the animal is in quite good condition; just cold.  It''s a good and unusual photograph.', '2009-01-07 06:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177131, 750823, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this several times, and for quite an extended few moments each time.  I can''t quite decide if it''s naturally-lying rocks and fog (which I''d love), or a breakwater made of rocks with water vaporized by an extended exposure (which I''d tolerate).  Alas, I think it may be the latter, but that doesn''t stop it from being really very beautiful.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this several times, and for quite an extended few moments each time.  I can''t quite decide if it''s naturally-lying rocks and fog (which I''d love), or a breakwater made of rocks with water vaporized by an extended exposure (which I''d tolerate).  Alas, I think it may be the latter, but that doesn''t stop it from being really very beautiful.', '2009-01-07 06:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177132, 751747, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness and reflections of this but find the bright green quite distracting</td>', 'I like the darkness and reflections of this but find the bright green quite distracting', '2009-01-07 06:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177136, 751286, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint but I wish I could see the eyes better</td>', 'I like the viewpoint but I wish I could see the eyes better', '2009-01-07 06:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
