(5177148, 751920, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nice range of tones and while I think the water works ok I would have preffered to see a little more clarity from a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Nice range of tones and while I think the water works ok I would have preffered to see a little more clarity from a faster shutter speed.', '2009-01-07 06:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177149, 750531, 25024, '<td valign="top">Ok, but the verticals could do with some straightening</td>', 'Ok, but the verticals could do with some straightening', '2009-01-07 06:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177150, 751612, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a classically good photograph.  Classical because it really could (setting aside the clothing) be from anytime from the late 19th century to the early 21st  and hopefully someone will still be doing this in <i>another</i> 100 years.  <br/> <br/>It''s technically good ... sometimes that matters, and this is such a time.  It''s natural, and doesn''t look like the product of some tacky ''action'' in digital post-processing.  It''s humanistic, without being sentimental.  It''s witty, without being heavily-laboured.  There are a lot of renowned photographers, even in places like <a href="//www.magnumphotos.com/archive/C.aspx?VP=XSpecific_MAG.AgencyHome_VPage&amp;pid=2K7O3R1VX08V&amp;XXAPXX=SubPanel0" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a>, that would be pleased to have this in their portfolio.  I''d sure be pleased to have it in mine, but the best  I can do is to add it to my favorites and award it the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is a classically good photograph.  Classical because it really could (setting aside the clothing) be from anytime from the late 19th century to the early 21st  and hopefully someone will still be doing this in another 100 years.   It''s technically good ... sometimes that matters, and this is such a time.  It''s natural, and doesn''t look like the product of some tacky ''action'' in digital post-processing.  It''s humanistic, without being sentimental.  It''s witty, without being heavily-laboured.  There are a lot of renowned photographers, even in places like this, that would be pleased to have this in their portfolio.  I''d sure be pleased to have it in mine, but the best  I can do is to add it to my favorites and award it the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-01-07 06:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177151, 751535, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good timing of natural excitement but the background needs a little more OOF it distracts a little</td>', 'Good timing of natural excitement but the background needs a little more OOF it distracts a little', '2009-01-07 06:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177153, 749392, 30364, '<td valign="top">I wish this wasn''t going to finish as far down as it will, only because I''d like more people  to look at it properly.  It''s a <i>much</i> more worthy photograph than it appears at first glance.  Alas, that''s all the glances it will get from most voters ... <i>''too small''; ''too blurry''; ''distracting''; ''poor composition''; ''too distorted''</i> ... yada yada yada.<br/> <br/>None of that carping is relevant to this quirky and very fine, enjoyable photograph.  9.</td>', 'I wish this wasn''t going to finish as far down as it will, only because I''d like more people  to look at it properly.  It''s a much more worthy photograph than it appears at first glance.  Alas, that''s all the glances it will get from most voters ... ''too small''; ''too blurry''; ''distracting''; ''poor composition''; ''too distorted'' ... yada yada yada. None of that carping is relevant to this quirky and very fine, enjoyable photograph.  9.', '2009-01-07 06:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177156, 751521, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like the way the leaf is highlighted, the tones and the diagonal of the composition but would have preferred the leaf to be nearer the upper third</td>', 'I like the way the leaf is highlighted, the tones and the diagonal of the composition but would have preferred the leaf to be nearer the upper third', '2009-01-07 06:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177157, 751968, 30364, '<td valign="top">I wish I did not immediately recognise who this work is by, so that I could comment objectively.  But this sure sense of style, this technique, and this wit (''Patois'') can surely have only one author here.  So I recuse myself from voting on it.  And my more detailed comments will have to go without saying.</td>', 'I wish I did not immediately recognise who this work is by, so that I could comment objectively.  But this sure sense of style, this technique, and this wit (''Patois'') can surely have only one author here.  So I recuse myself from voting on it.  And my more detailed comments will have to go without saying.', '2009-01-07 06:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5177162, 751082, 25024, '<td valign="top">I have real mixed feeling about this image. I like the lighter edges and the ice and the way the rusty links break through but the main submerged structure doesn''t appeal, sorry</td>', 'I have real mixed feeling about this image. I like the lighter edges and the ice and the way the rusty links break through but the main submerged structure doesn''t appeal, sorry', '2009-01-07 06:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
