(5179523, 748403, 30861, '<td valign="top">I knew this had to be you! One of my high scores, and I figured it would ribbon. From my years in Yosemite, this lovely vantage has special meaning for me (I may have had a view camera set up exactly where you were more than once), and your conditions, the conditions in which you shot, are perfect the scene. I''m glad you made the drive and congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I knew this had to be you! One of my high scores, and I figured it would ribbon. From my years in Yosemite, this lovely vantage has special meaning for me (I may have had a view camera set up exactly where you were more than once), and your conditions, the conditions in which you shot, are perfect the scene. I''m glad you made the drive and congrats on the ribbon!', '2009-01-08 00:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5179524, 748403, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this large but it carries well at a small size, too, which is an excellent tribute to your skills and knowledge.  Congratulations on a Free Study ribbon!!</td>', 'Would love to see this large but it carries well at a small size, too, which is an excellent tribute to your skills and knowledge.  Congratulations on a Free Study ribbon!!', '2009-01-08 00:22:46.000000', NULL, 0),
