(5179751, 749684, 102278, '<td valign="top">I''m glad it turned out to be real. If it turned out to be fake i was going to kick myself and drop my 8 down to 2 in my head! It''s grim and disturbing yes, but there is a place for this type of photography. It''s called reportage and some of the most amazing and important photography of the last 150 is pretty disturbing and falls into this category. Although you may be slightly blurring the edges a bit into art here. Good for you for entering it though. The only thing i don''t like is the exclamation mark at the end of the title.</td>', 'I''m glad it turned out to be real. If it turned out to be fake i was going to kick myself and drop my 8 down to 2 in my head! It''s grim and disturbing yes, but there is a place for this type of photography. It''s called reportage and some of the most amazing and important photography of the last 150 is pretty disturbing and falls into this category. Although you may be slightly blurring the edges a bit into art here. Good for you for entering it though. The only thing i don''t like is the exclamation mark at the end of the title.', '2009-01-08 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
