(5179985, 749679, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Roz!  How painful to get a 7.2+ and not win a ribbon!   The downside of Free Studies where the best of the best from all over the world vies for the top 3 spots.  And this is SUCH award worthy photography.  I LOVE how you used sepia tones.   Like all your macros, it takes my breath away.   Those eyes!  I''ve never seen anything so flawless.   <br/> <br/>I agree with Sherpet tho.  This is one of the best macros ever shown on dpChallenge.  Congratulations on your award winning photography -- and an honorable mention in an amazing challenge!</td>', 'Oh Roz!  How painful to get a 7.2+ and not win a ribbon!   The downside of Free Studies where the best of the best from all over the world vies for the top 3 spots.  And this is SUCH award worthy photography.  I LOVE how you used sepia tones.   Like all your macros, it takes my breath away.   Those eyes!  I''ve never seen anything so flawless.    I agree with Sherpet tho.  This is one of the best macros ever shown on dpChallenge.  Congratulations on your award winning photography -- and an honorable mention in an amazing challenge!', '2009-01-08 07:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
