(5179992, 749637, 24454, '<td valign="top">Greg!!  This is FABULOUS!  When I first saw this in the challenge, I thought it must be Roz''  You KNOW what a compliment that is.  In fact, "Roz,look out. .. your other half is hot on your heels"  :)   And I''m sure she is delighted and proud of your work.   <br/> <br/>I love the fact that it is one of the best macros I''ve seen, but it is in the context of a stunning photograph.  One you''d hang on your wall.  Congratulations on a personal best score, and an AMAZING photograph to add to your portfolio!</td>', 'Greg!!  This is FABULOUS!  When I first saw this in the challenge, I thought it must be Roz''  You KNOW what a compliment that is.  In fact, "Roz,look out. .. your other half is hot on your heels"  :)   And I''m sure she is delighted and proud of your work.    I love the fact that it is one of the best macros I''ve seen, but it is in the context of a stunning photograph.  One you''d hang on your wall.  Congratulations on a personal best score, and an AMAZING photograph to add to your portfolio!', '2009-01-08 07:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
