(5180259, 751170, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  I don''t know that I have ever seen a more beautiful photograph.  The night time exposure is absolutely perfect -- but the shadowy, snowy Mt. Ranier in the sunset background.   What a fine art masterpiece!  Congratulations on the blue ribbon -- but seriously -- this should be printed and sold to Seattle lovers for biiiiiiig bucks!<br/> <br/>Oh, and thanks for ammunition.  I have been foaming at the mouth to upgrade to that 5D Mark II.  I will show my husband this photo so he will understand why I need it too :)   As IF I could get a shot like this anyway, but at least with that camera I could get closer :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  I don''t know that I have ever seen a more beautiful photograph.  The night time exposure is absolutely perfect -- but the shadowy, snowy Mt. Ranier in the sunset background.   What a fine art masterpiece!  Congratulations on the blue ribbon -- but seriously -- this should be printed and sold to Seattle lovers for biiiiiiig bucks! Oh, and thanks for ammunition.  I have been foaming at the mouth to upgrade to that 5D Mark II.  I will show my husband this photo so he will understand why I need it too :)   As IF I could get a shot like this anyway, but at least with that camera I could get closer :) ', '2009-01-08 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5180262, 748403, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Mark!  Wow!  You know. . .lots of people can take pictures of the same spot -- but they sure can''t all turn out photos like this!  When you think about it, all photos have probably been done lots of times before, but the very few are able to take what''s been seen before and make it stand out, heads and shoulders above all the rest.  This is one of those photos!  Congratulations on the ribbon -- your fourth highest rated photo -- and just for having another fine art piece of magic in your portfolio!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Mark!  Wow!  You know. . .lots of people can take pictures of the same spot -- but they sure can''t all turn out photos like this!  When you think about it, all photos have probably been done lots of times before, but the very few are able to take what''s been seen before and make it stand out, heads and shoulders above all the rest.  This is one of those photos!  Congratulations on the ribbon -- your fourth highest rated photo -- and just for having another fine art piece of magic in your portfolio! ', '2009-01-08 10:41:19.000000', NULL, 0),
