(5180769, 751621, 80096, '<td valign="top">Jamie, as you and I both know, there is a lot of inequity in the voting process. However, we are powerless when it comes to the scoring of our entries. We do the best we can to capture good images but if the non-participants decide it''s not to their liking, there''s not a whole lot we can do about it. <br/> <br/>Thank you for your kind words. <br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-09 00:49:03.</i></td>', 'Jamie, as you and I both know, there is a lot of inequity in the voting process. However, we are powerless when it comes to the scoring of our entries. We do the best we can to capture good images but if the non-participants decide it''s not to their liking, there''s not a whole lot we can do about it.  Thank you for your kind words.  ', '2009-01-08 15:47:25.000000', '2009-01-09 00:49:03.000000', 0),
