(5180838, 751970, 68504, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones to tell this story.  It reminds me of Japanese brush painting, where the artist mixes the ink stick with water just so, dips the brush just so, and applies it just so, the dark and light and texture happening as intended.</td>', 'Excellent tones to tell this story.  It reminds me of Japanese brush painting, where the artist mixes the ink stick with water just so, dips the brush just so, and applies it just so, the dark and light and texture happening as intended.', '2009-01-08 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
