(5181335, 750117, 61315, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image of light, color, and geometric lines Tom. I like how the doors and light balance the composition. I''m afraid most voters here don''t have the background in art that you have to be able to appreciate this. :-(<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-08 21:35:49.</i></td>', 'Very interesting image of light, color, and geometric lines Tom. I like how the doors and light balance the composition. I''m afraid most voters here don''t have the background in art that you have to be able to appreciate this. :-(', '2009-01-08 21:34:59.000000', '2009-01-08 21:35:49.000000', 0),
