(5181344, 748030, 80096, '<td valign="top">Sandy! This is soooo different... I expected to see a beautiful bird. This is definitely a departure from your usual style and very unique. Beautiful colors and stunning detail. Congrats on your high finish!</td>', 'Sandy! This is soooo different... I expected to see a beautiful bird. This is definitely a departure from your usual style and very unique. Beautiful colors and stunning detail. Congrats on your high finish!', '2009-01-08 21:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
