(5182253, 751771, 42013, '<td valign="top">Hi Ken. My own shot crossed my mind when I saw yours! Several of your comments related to the eyes and their lack of sharpness. Looking back at mine, i''d say mine were overdone(remember the era of "pimp my eyes"). Somewhere between the two would have been the best IMO.<br/> <br/>Perfect color match on the ornament and her eyes. Your lighting is professional.<br/> <br/>She is beautiful and the score is secondary... Thanks for being a fan of my niece and her photo. ;)</td>', 'Hi Ken. My own shot crossed my mind when I saw yours! Several of your comments related to the eyes and their lack of sharpness. Looking back at mine, i''d say mine were overdone(remember the era of "pimp my eyes"). Somewhere between the two would have been the best IMO. Perfect color match on the ornament and her eyes. Your lighting is professional. She is beautiful and the score is secondary... Thanks for being a fan of my niece and her photo. ;)', '2009-01-09 14:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
