(5182897, 751170, 102562, '<td valign="top">As someone who lives in the Seattle area I have to say- this is one of the best (if not the best due to color) pictures of the city I have aver seen. It is nearly impossible to get a clear shot of the city and mountain at the same time, and this picture highlights them both perfectly. You should seriously sell this to some magazines- I''d love to buy a print of it myself. Let me know if you''re selling!</td>', 'As someone who lives in the Seattle area I have to say- this is one of the best (if not the best due to color) pictures of the city I have aver seen. It is nearly impossible to get a clear shot of the city and mountain at the same time, and this picture highlights them both perfectly. You should seriously sell this to some magazines- I''d love to buy a print of it myself. Let me know if you''re selling!', '2009-01-10 01:08:03.000000', NULL, 0),
