(5206460, 751914, 67152, '<td valign="top">A very cool feel of this image - the highlighted berries, the darkness surrounding it.  Sorry about the DQ<br/> <br/>You need to loet us folks in the Northeast know when you are going to be up our way!  We would make a GTG of it...</td>', 'A very cool feel of this image - the highlighted berries, the darkness surrounding it.  Sorry about the DQ You need to loet us folks in the Northeast know when you are going to be up our way!  We would make a GTG of it...', '2009-01-20 09:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5206463, 750369, 102024, '<td valign="top">I love astronomy.  And I absolutely love gazing at celestial objects.  Wonderful photograph!  Who gave this a 1?!?!  How can anyone give any decent image of a nebula a one?!??</td>', 'I love astronomy.  And I absolutely love gazing at celestial objects.  Wonderful photograph!  Who gave this a 1?!?!  How can anyone give any decent image of a nebula a one?!??', '2009-01-20 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5207260, 745855, 46314, '<td valign="top">I think this should''ve rated higher. I like the flowing horizontal bands of colour and sharpness of the image. In any other challenge (i.e. where they don''t vote as harshly as free study), this probably would have averaged over 6.</td>', 'I think this should''ve rated higher. I like the flowing horizontal bands of colour and sharpness of the image. In any other challenge (i.e. where they don''t vote as harshly as free study), this probably would have averaged over 6.', '2009-01-20 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5207886, 751769, 25678, '<td valign="top">Surprised I didn''t leave a comment. I was one of the 8. The toning, movement and composition work together to create a great shot.</td>', 'Surprised I didn''t leave a comment. I was one of the 8. The toning, movement and composition work together to create a great shot.', '2009-01-20 23:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5209509, 751439, 30214, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why people invoke either Norman Rockwell or Currier &amp; Ives. for me this is a clear reference to Pieter Brueghel the Elder,especially since it is taken in Holland. Great work!</td>', 'I don''t know why people invoke either Norman Rockwell or Currier & Ives. for me this is a clear reference to Pieter Brueghel the Elder,especially since it is taken in Holland. Great work!', '2009-01-21 12:48:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5209592, 751443, 67697, '<td valign="top">Why would you have taken a beating?  It''s beautiful!  Score''s not that bad either :)  I like the contrast of dark tree in a cold, white environment.</td>', 'Why would you have taken a beating?  It''s beautiful!  Score''s not that bad either :)  I like the contrast of dark tree in a cold, white environment.', '2009-01-21 13:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5209611, 750081, 67697, '<td valign="top">Those look like some seriously fun sledding hills.  Interesting contrast between people having fun in the natural environment AND the signs of industry and city life in the background.</td>', 'Those look like some seriously fun sledding hills.  Interesting contrast between people having fun in the natural environment AND the signs of industry and city life in the background.', '2009-01-21 13:35:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5210168, 751439, 46314, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful scene. I can feel the magic in the moment captured in this photograph - can almost hear all the laughter and merriment. I''d love to visit there on a day like this. I have no idea why the voters aren''t being kinder to you in these free studies. You have a really nice style. Keep at it.</td>', 'Such a beautiful scene. I can feel the magic in the moment captured in this photograph - can almost hear all the laughter and merriment. I''d love to visit there on a day like this. I have no idea why the voters aren''t being kinder to you in these free studies. You have a really nice style. Keep at it.', '2009-01-21 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5210336, 749637, 57886, '<td valign="top">Really REALLY beautiful picture...</td>', 'Really REALLY beautiful picture...', '2009-01-21 19:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
