(5222873, 750997, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Lydia. I really like the composition and the complimentary background. I''m shocked that there is no motion blur considering the shutter speed. <br/> <br/>What were your thoughts in planning this shot? What are trying to convey with the shallow depth of field? Did you choose it because of the background?</td>', 'Nice shot Lydia. I really like the composition and the complimentary background. I''m shocked that there is no motion blur considering the shutter speed.  What were your thoughts in planning this shot? What are trying to convey with the shallow depth of field? Did you choose it because of the background?', '2009-01-27 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
