(5228328, 751984, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait because it doesn''t look contrived.  It looks natural.  The way he is looking back suggest any number of thoughts from the subject, "Are you kidding me?", "If only you knew."  I like his expression.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'I like this portrait because it doesn''t look contrived.  It looks natural.  The way he is looking back suggest any number of thoughts from the subject, "Are you kidding me?", "If only you knew."  I like his expression.  Nice portrait.', '2009-01-31 01:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
