(5244199, 748404, 30214, '<td valign="top">hey Chris, just came across this photo! Very nice shot, and indeed would be interesting to have all our dads together :). On the surface, the portraits are very similar, but boy, if you look deep into their eyes, they are so different, and so engaging, each in his own way.<br/></td>', 'hey Chris, just came across this photo! Very nice shot, and indeed would be interesting to have all our dads together :). On the surface, the portraits are very similar, but boy, if you look deep into their eyes, they are so different, and so engaging, each in his own way.', '2009-02-07 18:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
