(5588050, 750662, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve incorporated the lines into your composition. I agree with Hotpasta on the suggestion to use monochrome. It would help bring even more focus on the lines. <br/> <br/>This looks like a tough scene to expose for: there''s some blown highlights but also some dark areas where we''d like to see more detail. Shooting from the other side of the support might have helped. (I <i>think</i> you could still get the same composition if I remember correctly)</td>', 'I like the way you''ve incorporated the lines into your composition. I agree with Hotpasta on the suggestion to use monochrome. It would help bring even more focus on the lines.  This looks like a tough scene to expose for: there''s some blown highlights but also some dark areas where we''d like to see more detail. Shooting from the other side of the support might have helped. (I think you could still get the same composition if I remember correctly)', '2009-07-27 16:43:29.000000', NULL, 0),
