(5872139, 748336, 114314, '<td valign="top">This piece is very interesting, Hvae you ever thought about making calendars? Sometimes wildlife photography can com off looking very mediocre, but, not yours, noope. It has an interesting artistic perspective. The Masculinity of the male ram just forces it''s way throughout the image. I would really enjoy looking at it while checking my appointments for june.</td>', 'This piece is very interesting, Hvae you ever thought about making calendars? Sometimes wildlife photography can com off looking very mediocre, but, not yours, noope. It has an interesting artistic perspective. The Masculinity of the male ram just forces it''s way throughout the image. I would really enjoy looking at it while checking my appointments for june.', '2010-02-18 10:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5889834, 751902, 101117, '<td valign="top">Food photography is something I''m not particularly good at (probably as a result of me not being particularly good at artificial lighting) so whenever I see it well done I marvel, and this definitely fits the bill!<br/> <br/>Obviously the first thing that strikes me is the nice lighting you have here, it''s soft enough to make the shot appealing but there are still some little shadows like the one under the sauce bowl and around the edge of the plate which really add to the composition of the shot.<br/> <br/>The only thing about the shot that I''m not 100% sure about is the colour of the noodles, it seems as though it may be a tiny bit off, or perhaps I''m just not cooking mine right :)</td>', 'Food photography is something I''m not particularly good at (probably as a result of me not being particularly good at artificial lighting) so whenever I see it well done I marvel, and this definitely fits the bill! Obviously the first thing that strikes me is the nice lighting you have here, it''s soft enough to make the shot appealing but there are still some little shadows like the one under the sauce bowl and around the edge of the plate which really add to the composition of the shot. The only thing about the shot that I''m not 100% sure about is the colour of the noodles, it seems as though it may be a tiny bit off, or perhaps I''m just not cooking mine right :)', '2010-03-04 06:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5903646, 751868, 69008, '<td valign="top">The dark blue sky, and bright colors and textures of the rock create a very good contrast. It makes both the rock and sky stand out in this.</td>', 'The dark blue sky, and bright colors and textures of the rock create a very good contrast. It makes both the rock and sky stand out in this.', '2010-03-14 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
